\up6 \outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec3 Hi Michael,\up0 \
\up6 I received your letter last week with horror and disbelief. I was shocked to realise that I had not referenced the parts of my work where I used AI.\up0 \
\up6 Looking back, I believe this happened because I was extremely unwell at the time due to complications from diabetes. I spent hours in A&E and was then admitted to hospital for treatment, where I was put on drips until my blood sugar returned to normal.\up0 \
\up6 On the same day I was discharged, I had to submit my assignment. I am very sorry for what happened. My mind was overwhelmed, and I failed to remember to acknowledge that I had used AI and explain how I had used it.\up0 \
\up6 I understand that this was wrong, and it is not something I had done before or since. I deeply regret the mistake and can only explain that my illness at the time affected my judgment and caused me to forget.\up0 \
\up6 Yours Sincerely,\up0 \
\up6 Tobore.\up0 \
